### Shipping charges (AuctionService, also through the gateway as /shipping/...).
### The charge is calculated by the backend: size class + road distance (straight line × 1.3; km, miles in the USA)
### + the country's rates. Pickup is free. Rates are seeded as PLACEHOLDERS – an admin sets the real ones below.
### Tokens: sign in as in IdentityService.http (the app's flow); the admin is the seeded Seed:AdminEmail account.

@gateway = http://localhost:6001
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN
@adminToken = PASTE_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN
@listingId = PASTE_LISTING_ID

### Estimate for a listing to a location (what the listing page shows: "Shipping to Kukatpally: ~₹350 (estimate)").
### Secunderabad, Hyderabad:
GET {{gateway}}/shipping/estimate?listingId={{listingId}}&lat=17.4399&lon=78.4983&country=IN
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Another country → not available ("Ships within India only")
GET {{gateway}}/shipping/estimate?listingId={{listingId}}&lat=6.5244&lon=3.3792&country=NG
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### The rate table (one country, or all). isPlaceholder = true until an admin sets the values.
GET {{gateway}}/shipping/rates?country=IN
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: set the real rate for India / Medium (₹ per km). Existing orders keep their charge.
PUT {{gateway}}/shipping/rates/IN/Medium
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "baseFee": 150, "ratePerUnit": 2.5, "minFee": 150, "maxFee": 1800, "maxDistance": 2500 }

### Admin: USA / Large ($ per mile)
PUT {{gateway}}/shipping/rates/US/Large
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "baseFee": 45, "ratePerUnit": 0.85, "minFee": 45, "maxFee": 450, "maxDistance": 2500 }

### A buyer chooses Shipping on an order: address text + the delivery location → the charge is calculated and fixed.
POST {{gateway}}/orders/PASTE_ORDER_ID/delivery-method
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "Shipping",
  "address": { "name": "Ravi Kumar", "phone": "+919876543210", "line1": "Flat 4, Road 2", "city": "Secunderabad", "postcode": "500003", "countryCode": "IN" },
  "latitude": 17.4399,
  "longitude": 78.4983
}
